Z||000000||Fformula88||06-22-2000||04:36 PM||||Last night I had my Fiero up to the Niagara River where I go rollerblading.  While I was skating along, I noticed some nice looking chrome hubcaps on a really old and rust hole filled Chevy Celebrity sedan.  BUT WAIT!  Are those cross drilled rotors????  Man I wish I had my Camera.  These hubcaps had fake cross drilled rotors on them.  Unfortunately, this mod does NOT add horsepower.  But it is guarabteed to take 25 feet of your 60-0 distances!  I "wish" I didn't have aluminum rims so I could put these on my car!||||reg||10
Z||000001||GT Bastard||06-22-2000||04:51 PM||||I saw those at the local K-Mapart store.  Pretty jazzy stuff.  But much to my dismay, it didn't improve my braking!  I returned them as defective of course...||||reg||1
